Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.32,0:00:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The search will continue,\Nbut let's suspend it for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.98,0:00:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We must let it decide its own course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll observe it first,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,then combine it with JoJo Kujo's memories\Nfor everyone to find out the real truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.48,0:00:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This weird little fruit baby probably\Nabsorbed the bone when it was germinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.14,0:00:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And Palesnake is here somewhere inside\Nthis prison to find out what's behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What will come out of this pod?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.50,0:00:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here because he wants to know\Nwhat begins when it's finally born.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to go find the main body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.14,0:00:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And when you do, blow him off the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.34,0:00:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is way worse than I imagined!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That disgusting troll hit my face with\Nhis foul poisonous drool before I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.92,0:00:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my mouth is half gone, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Little or little.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.48,0:01:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I go after Jolene's boat? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.20,0:01:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan was to go find that\NStan's user and assassinate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.58,0:01:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,so goddammit I'm sticking to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.84,0:01:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only way it gets done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.56,0:01:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna play.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.80,0:01:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.22,0:01:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.46,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.14,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a person who is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.46,0:02:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Step to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.51,0:02:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Break out, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.06,0:03:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be a silly question, but\Nwhy'd you make him stop the boat here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.22,0:03:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, quick, turn off the\Nengine, and keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, do you hear something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.12,0:03:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I told you to turn off the engine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up, buffoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.30,0:03:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Abnormal conditions traced in\Nall disciplined cell zones.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Security now set to level\Nfour in its entire complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Alertness is at max priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.78,0:03:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A 12.7 millimeter heavy machine gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.90,0:03:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Operational distance range\Nis 1,000 to 2,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.38,0:03:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If we were barely grazed\Nby one of those bullets,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.18,0:03:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,both our limbs and this\Nboat would be shattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, quiet down, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.28,0:03:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making waves. They'll see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.50,0:03:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll break the steering wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.14,0:03:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.46,0:04:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If they knew we were here, there\Nwould already be a hail of gunfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.16,0:04:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,At 210!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.08,0:04:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I just saw a ripple in\Nthe water by that grove!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.60,0:04:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a fish or Cutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.98,0:04:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They're headed right to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.60,0:04:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, if you take these leaves, Master,\Nyou'll be able to make a... You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.62,0:04:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to keep your trap shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.10,0:04:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, please, you don't understand, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.26,0:04:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this frond and fold it in half.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You weave the leaflets, then\Nyou place it up against here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You then secure it with a stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.86,0:04:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the sap and smear it on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.84,0:04:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody's ready\Nfor the plan, together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.26,0:05:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.20,0:05:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All units back to the\NDiscipline Cell Ward now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I repeat, abort and return!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.62,0:05:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't standard protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be pretty serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.37,0:05:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit, it's them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.70,0:05:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They saw us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.92,0:05:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Start the engine up and let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.54,0:05:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.45,0:05:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not enough time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.68,0:05:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be dead before it even spins!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.18,0:05:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of crap did you pull of\Nthe discipline cells, scumbags!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.10,0:06:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay right where we can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.94,0:06:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down in the ground and\Ndon't try anything funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.68,0:06:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you giant freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.42,0:06:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna get shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.74,0:06:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on your knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we can borrow one of theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.72,0:06:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And by we, I mean you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.46,0:06:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.82,0:06:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be taking this boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.52,0:06:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.72,0:06:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The crocodiles are hungry,\Nso try not to get eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.12,0:06:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for a drive! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, are you okay with plants?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep heading towards the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.38,0:06:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun's getting low, we'd better hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.84,0:06:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so brutal, treating\Nme like a base object.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.34,0:06:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, may I ask you\Nto stop that whistling?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.44,0:07:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I find it highly irksome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.96,0:07:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.87,0:07:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,those guards might come after us, and I\Nwant to keep an ear out for their engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.20,0:07:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.78,0:07:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, may I ask you\Nto stop that whistling?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.80,0:07:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I find it highly irksome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.84,0:07:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my voice is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.06,0:07:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.82,0:07:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stealing the green child and escaping\Nwith it wasn't his only goal here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.08,0:07:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He was secretly attacking us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.10,0:07:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.68,0:07:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your breathing is very\Nerratic and shallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.34,0:08:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So is mine, Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.32,0:08:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you feel my rapid heartbeat\Nsuddenly being so close?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.38,0:08:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do you fully understand\Nmy feelings for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.60,0:08:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my eyes, my tongue. Look, are you\Ntelling me you can't find any words?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.34,0:08:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that feeling\Nall too well but words
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.40,0:08:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,are unnecessary see i\Nfeel the exact same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.82,0:08:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to kiss me\Ndon't you how about the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.68,0:08:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,type where our tongues\Njoin in sultry tango?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.74,0:08:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,When and how did that\Ncreature attack us? I didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.08,0:08:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,even notice we clearly need\Nto watch him every second?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.70,0:09:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confused. Help me out\Nhere. Do you want to kiss or
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,not or is this an indication\Nthat you're partial to more
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.04,0:09:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,unorthodox proclivities do\Nyou prefer to kiss like a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.86,0:09:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,contortionist he's an automatic\Npursuit style stand he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.06,0:09:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He obediently follows\Norders like a slave and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.54,0:09:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,grovels at your feet to\Nseem harmless and pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, that's his\Neffed-up little trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.18,0:09:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a stand that specifically waits for\Nthe moments when we're most off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.92,0:09:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he strikes automatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.30,0:09:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll both be dead if\Nwe don't do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.68,0:09:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, my back is turned now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Try attacking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I need Anastasia to notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.18,0:09:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That is my name and don't you forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.10,0:09:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.14,0:09:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's what happens when\Nyou lick a frog's skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.02,0:10:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You make a gooey liquid made of a delicious\Ncombination of lard, blood, and brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.34,0:10:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then rub it all over your\Nskin, your entire body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a wonderful beauty secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.70,0:10:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It gives you superior hydration.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you desire, I can catch 10 more and\Nmake you a miniskirt out of the skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.36,0:10:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you don't mind me saying so, I\Nwould be incredibly honored to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.94,0:10:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make your legs look\Nvery long and slender.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.26,0:10:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,your calves shapely and your butt perky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, tell me if\Nthere's something wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.38,0:10:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If a trigger is really necessary here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.12,0:10:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,then it makes sense that there'd\Nbe a trigger to his attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.16,0:10:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's worse, if they're\Nlaunched automatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.68,0:10:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly what I was waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.18,0:10:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I stretched my thread over my skin\Nand waited for something to touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When I look away, that's when\Nthe automatic attack starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.12,0:11:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.36,0:11:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitting at your weakest point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.06,0:11:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But also, I figured out\Na sneaky ass method.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mosquitos.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.84,0:11:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, what's happening to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.46,0:11:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.37,0:11:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, was I wrong about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.44,0:11:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not only mosquitoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, he's obviously got other ways to\Nhit us besides those blood-sucking bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.02,0:11:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.22,0:11:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.70,0:11:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.10,0:11:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I continue driving\Nus back to supposed safety?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.46,0:11:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you prefer to fight with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,One-on-one, as the expression goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Or would you like to run?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.72,0:11:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.90,0:11:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The mosquitoes are just part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.60,0:11:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But what the hell else\Nis he going to let loose?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.20,0:11:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's doing something horrible\Nto us that we can't even see!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.10,0:12:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You might like to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe this is the very last\Nchance you have to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, wretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.36,0:12:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself for your\Nsingle greatest regret,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.06,0:12:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,that you were shat out into this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.38,0:12:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to the back of the boat,\Nin the port side corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.52,0:12:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take out everything you've been hiding\Nfrom us I want you to lay it out on my
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.64,0:12:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,feet and show me no funny business okay I
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,have two beetles there's\Nalso a karaoke mic
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.92,0:12:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,packets of sugar substitute and these\Nthree frogs I also have a raw frog skin one
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,head of broccoli and\Nfour mock strawberries
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.78,0:12:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and two used matches and that's everything
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.88,0:13:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you it's not as creepy stuff\Nwe're upwind of him but something is still
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.00,0:13:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,attacking us what the hell is it though\Nso you embody an automatic pursuit stand
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.44,0:13:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,then which means whatever your attack\Ntarget is it has to be fixed you are correct
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.06,0:13:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,it's completely fixed ever since I first
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.44,0:13:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,touched Jolene Cujo well.\NYou know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.02,0:13:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So with Jolene as the target,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.02,0:13:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,you were ordered by your\Nuser not to run away,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.36,0:13:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,or in fact do anything else,\Nuntil she's been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.12,0:13:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya, Ya Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.58,0:13:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you're planning\Nto stay by her side,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.80,0:13:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I think there's something\Nyou should know, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That would leave me with no other\Nchoice but to finish you off, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.98,0:13:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is it a spit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.32,0:13:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya Ya Ma, do you still not understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.08,0:13:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can destroy or stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.60,0:13:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you'll have\Nto get used to the idea
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.56,0:13:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There was only ever one way either of\Nyou were going to survive this trip,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.46,0:13:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and that was to escape me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.28,0:13:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas you have failed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we're gonna have\Nto stop this boat and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.14,0:14:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All that foamy spray flying up\Nif he's mixed his nasty saliva?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.90,0:14:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He used to attack us before\Nwith the marsh water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.24,0:14:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We're now getting splashed\Nwith we are screwed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.80,0:14:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, stand up and get\Nyour ass in the driver's seat
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.08,0:14:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Make the boat go faster, move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.24,0:14:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me? Come on, get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, it's the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Higher speed creates more spray.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.64,0:14:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do that, we'll melt\Nlike hot wax in minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, most certainly, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.14,0:14:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I will do precisely as you have asked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.08,0:14:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:15:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, it seems like he's\Nno longer attacking us,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.74,0:15:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,despite the fact that he\Nclearly hasn't sped up the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.82,0:15:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ya, ya, ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.94,0:15:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,S-something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.84,0:15:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dixus birds! Hide! Hide! Freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.60,0:15:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Dive or drive,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.18,0:15:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,it doesn't matter what his attack methods\Nare, we don't have to worry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Since this scaly, wretched freak is\Na perfect automatic pursuit stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.70,0:15:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I simply implanted a frog into\Nhis brain and subsequently
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,attached its brain right\Nto his pursuit sensor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.20,0:15:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, just like a frog,\Nhe'll be in perpetual pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.84,0:15:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.68,0:15:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.22,0:15:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.80,0:15:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.71,0:15:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I am an automatic pursuer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.38,0:15:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been ordered to kill Jolene Cujo\Nand abscond with the Green Child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.48,0:15:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:15:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.50,0:15:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been derailed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.84,0:16:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to disseminate my spit\Nspray and attack Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.46,0:16:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rub some plastic onto the\Npropellers to create static electricity,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.22,0:16:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and its resistance will\Nscatter my spitflex everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.52,0:16:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He can try, but he'll\Nnever figure this one out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.26,0:16:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't get past my fear of the birds!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.70,0:16:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.61,0:16:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Must get away from them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.30,0:16:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I wet myself, just like a frog!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.54,0:16:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful body that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.56,0:16:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, I have to catch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.52,0:16:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to catch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.72,0:16:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, a beetle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it's safe to\Nleave him alone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.98,0:16:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, we need to get back\Nto FF and heal your wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.46,0:16:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But before that, we must wait for\Nthem to take out D &G and return.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.50,0:16:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.78,0:16:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen crazy shit in\Nhere, but nothing like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.56,0:16:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did the guards and prisoners go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.36,0:16:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.38,0:16:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only been 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.04,0:17:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And what are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.14,0:17:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there actual trees growing\Nin here all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.90,0:17:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to report this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.88,0:17:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's the deal with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.44,0:17:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Can he not talk or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.34,0:17:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's prisoner number ME14067.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He goes by D &G.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,His forearm is just blood and bone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.28,0:17:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hanging by a thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.64,0:17:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in no shape for questioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.04,0:17:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got some balls sending in\Na gross creepy stand like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.68,0:17:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So is payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.76,0:17:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's some FF ammo for your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.92,0:17:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey I know that guy. He's\Nfather, Poochie, the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,chaplain did they bring him\Nhere for that bastard's last
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.84,0:17:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,rites don't worry about him\Njust focus the most important
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.18,0:17:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,thing right now is making\Nsure D &G is dead as dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.42,0:17:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,359, 367, 373,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.56,0:18:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,379, 383, 389, 397.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.72,0:18:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The 300s are done, now the 400s.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.52,0:18:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting with 401, 409.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Since D &G is injured to within a mere\Nhair's breadth of bleeding to death,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.80,0:18:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,that can only mean that somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.94,0:18:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Cujoh is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.02,0:18:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And the massive amount of those\Nwithered and rotting plant remains,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.58,0:18:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I surmise, must be due to the\Npresence of Dio's bone buried within.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.90,0:18:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Truly, Dio's bone employed the prisoners'
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.90,0:18:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,bodies to instigate a movement\Nthat's beyond my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.92,0:18:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.56,0:18:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We should celebrate that\Nthis has finally begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,For 22 years, I have awaited this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.74,0:18:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything and everything D &G saw here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.18,0:18:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to pull out of the\Nman himself while I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, Survivors Guccio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.62,0:18:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it seems you were\Nwitness to none of the action,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.16,0:19:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I still believe something special\Nwas born from all those plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.82,0:19:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree that\Nbirthed Voren's rejoicing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.64,0:19:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And that will soon belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.46,0:19:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to know the\Ndefinition of true happiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.80,0:19:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When you hold heaven in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.62,0:19:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We must praise what has been born unto us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.40,0:19:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It is heaven embodied.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.56,0:19:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A new world has opened up and I am\Ngoing to be at the vanguard of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.58,0:19:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.49,0:19:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Give due praise to this deep emotion!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.00,0:19:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Handel's exquisite messiah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.18,0:19:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A time-honored masterpiece!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.80,0:19:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.71,0:19:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How fitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.63,0:19:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A perfect piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.76,0:19:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As if the sounds themselves were aglow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.82,0:19:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's often said that Handel\Ncontinued to play this
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.48,0:19:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,his own magnum opus until\Nthe day before his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.62,0:20:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna leave D &G to the medics\Nand question them after treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.96,0:20:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rest of us are gonna\Nsearch for the prisoners and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.38,0:20:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,guards to see where in the\Nhell they could We're to God!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.82,0:20:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.62,0:20:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, I'm going to\Nquestion him before his treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.72,0:20:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Losing sight of that newly born miracle\Nwould make me very, very unhappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's back it out! Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.32,0:20:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That face!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.12,0:20:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I recognize the face\Nhiding under that hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.98,0:20:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat this, pal! You should know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.50,0:20:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,users with automatic pursuit stands are\Ndefenseless when under counterattack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.98,0:20:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just the risk you take!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:20:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I was right! FF!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:20:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is she at this Discipline Cell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.70,0:21:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And how long? Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.18,0:21:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She's going after TNG!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a disk!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.98,0:21:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Pale Snake is here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.92,0:21:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Which direction did he\Nthrow that damn disk from?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.78,0:21:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,479.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.74,0:21:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,487.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.20,0:21:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,491.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.68,0:21:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,499.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.34,0:21:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.25,0:21:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's who threw it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.66,0:21:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.96,0:21:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.87,0:21:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is troublesome indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.94,0:21:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're currently here planning\Nto unceremoniously eliminate D &G,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.26,0:21:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that must mean his stand, Yayama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.78,0:21:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,is simultaneously after\NJolene's life, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.60,0:21:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.51,0:21:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.78,0:21:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How fortuitous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.90,0:21:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something to ask him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.92,0:21:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,His death would be quite\Nproblematic, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.38,0:21:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to tell me\Nthat Pale Snake is really...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.46,0:22:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so what are you going to do if I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.84,0:22:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Will I then immediately\Nbecome top priority?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.52,0:22:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Or will finishing off D &G still\Ntake precedence over me? I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.22,0:22:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father Poochie!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.42,0:22:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.92,0:22:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.02,0:22:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.80,0:22:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place other than here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.56,0:22:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.80,0:22:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:23:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.02,0:23:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.00,0:23:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,about all
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.30,0:23:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the things I'd like to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.44,0:23:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,In my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.46,0:23:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.46,0:23:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.38,0:23:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.76,0:23:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,From today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.90,0:23:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.82,0:24:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
